  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palm Oil Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: palm oil. Beneficiaries: 851 (432 of whom are women). Description: In the target area of the project, women extract palm oil at low yields. This project will improve the income of women producers of palm oil through investments in infrastructure, equiptment, agricultural inputs, technical assistance, and training.</narrative>
  </description>
